Greetings all,

First post ever here. I have been playing Nethack for a bit over a year
with my first ascension recently as a Valkyrie. Since then I have been
working on healers pretty diligently with some good games by my
reckoning but never have gotten so far along as to see Rodney again.

I have never played archaeologists much but have been nursing one along
to play with as a break from the healer games. I have him brought up to
XL 14 with AC -32. He's been down to Medusa for a brief look but didn't
want to go further since he was desperately short of good scrolls.  So
I retreated (after a nasty encounter with an L or an N) to level 12
where there was an aligned altar with a priest as well as the portal to
Ludios and my main stash one level above. I oh so carefully cleared out
Ludios without a lot of gain but did end up with enough money to get my
naked AC down to -1, plus some silver dragon scales and a scroll of
enchant armor (the only one I have found so far). So I added SDSM to
the kit and that's what brought my AC down to its current level.

Since I had water walking shoes and some potions that I likely wouldn't
need I went back to Ludios and made some potions of water. Then brought
them back to the altar to make some holy water. That's when I made

Mistake number 1

I walked up to the altar, forgot to drop the potions, forgot to hide my
luckstone and prayed. I got crowned. Rats! Now I am gonna have to work
before I can pray again. I was on my second wand of create monster when
I made

Mistake number 2

I created a gas spore right on the altar and without much thought I
whacked the useless thing. It blasted the priest and he got mad. So he
was whacking me and making insects but not doing too much damage to me.
Rather than leave I killed some ants and after #offering about three of
them got that feeling of reconciliation. I prayed and got my HP
restored and even a golden glow for a few more HP. My god likes me I
thought. But this priest keeps whacking me. So I made

Mistake number 3

I whacked the priest. My god didn't really like me after all. Now the
insects are biting, the priest is whacking and cursing and lightning is
bolting from the sky (or up there somewhere). As I started to run away
I was paralyzed and then could only watch as my HP dwindled while I was
bludgeoned, bit and blasted. At AC -32 it takes a while to get whittled
down to zero HP but I kept hoping I would wake up. Didn't happen. But
wait... I forgot about the AoLS. Revived and with full HP I beat a
retreat to my stash on D11.

Now I wonder if this game can even be won. I suspect it can but the
chances seem slim (they are always slim for me though). The main
problem is that there are almost no altars in this game. The only other
one is the non-aligned one in minetown. So I am not sure if I can even
get back in good graces with my god. And without that and the
accompanying ability to make some holy water, well it looks like a lost
cause to me. I would sure be glad to be told otherwise though.

